      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The problems are discussed that are encountered in diagnosing instability of the middle and lower cervical spine on the basis of conventional radiographs. Two aspects are considered: 11 elementary radiological signs are presented; the corresponding radiological syndromes, their clinical presentations, and the roentgenographic signs are discussed. Both aspects are illustrated by means of appropriate radiographs."},
